OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dead and three in hospital
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died following a single-car
OL,7,Fcrash in Glasgow which left three
OL,8,Fothers in hospital.
OL,10,FKennishead Road in Thornliebank was
OL,11,Fclosed for about nine hours following
OL,12,Fthe incident involving a black Vauxhall
OL,13,FAstra at about 19:25 on Sunday.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland said the woman was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene. Two other
OL,17,Fwomen, aged 18 and 33, and the male
OL,18,Fdriver, 20, were taken to hospital for
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
